; Test 01d (K bui6/mapslib/mikesmaplib.bb): round trip with missing
; residents.  The .xtra names blitzlibs:libmacs.res and blitzlibs:blitzoffs.res;
; blitzlibs: does not exist: two DOS requesters (answered "cancel" by
; reqtrap, REQUESTER: lines in stdout) and two blitz2 error requesters
; " OKAY " (comdata error) after the version requester - seen in the
; reference (stage 1 session 1).  Afterwards TED reopens its screen (other
; geometry: the label column).  Then SAVE over the file and QUIT.
; @source K bui6/mapslib/mikesmaplib.bb
; @roundtrip
; @est 3
; @expect exists mikesmaplib.bb.info
; @expect exists mikesmaplib.bb.xtra
timeout 10
wait req "OKEE DOKEE"
gad 1
wait req "OKAY"
gad 1
wait req "OKAY"
gad 1
wait screen
dump start
menu 0 2
wait freq "Name to save file as"
freq ok
wait screen
dump saved
menu 0 9
wait exit
